  ('c221887c-6d8e-5227-9392-e51ccd247a95', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g12-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$What does the sentence "Each question reminded the meadow that it needed her" reveal that helps develop the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Teska answers in riddles because she has forgotten the exact answers.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The meadow animals resent Teska and visit her only out of fear.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-character"},{"text":"Teska is the meadow's elected leader and must answer every question.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"Teska's secrecy comes from a wish to be needed, the motive the fable goes on to question.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Teska's secrecy comes from a wish to be needed, the motive the fable goes on to question.$q$, $q$The line explains why she "liked being asked," exposing the need for importance that the ending reverses. Nothing suggests she forgot her knowledge; she knows it well.$q$, 'draft', '14de3638-bd5a-502a-a9c5-697b5d2d8f23')
