   $q$Which word best fills the blank at the beginning of sentence 6?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-contrast"},{"text":"Because of this,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-for-contrast"},{"text":"However,","is_correct":true},{"text":"First,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"sequence-for-contrast"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$However,$q$, $q$Sentence 5 tells about an improvement, but sentence 6 tells about a problem that was still there, so the contrast word "However" fits. "Because of this" is wrong because adding pedals did not cause the bumpy ride.$q$, 'draft', 'e2de9567-ca50-50ba-8204-e91270077fdf')
