        '3-5', $q$Learning the Recorder$q$, $q$(1) This fall, our class started learning to play the recorder in music class. (2) At first, my recorder only made loud squeaks. (3) Mr. Haddad showed us how to cover the holes with the pads of our fingers. (4) He also taught us to blow softly, as if we were cooling warm soup. (5) ____, my notes started to sound clear and smooth.

(6) Every week, we practice a new song. (7) Last week, we learned a song with only three notes. (8) This week's song is harder because it has five notes. (9) Practicing at home helps me keep up with the class. (10) ____, I play for ten minutes each night after dinner.

(11) Learning an instrument takes patience. (12) I still make mistakes, but I can hear myself getting better.$q$, 'draft')
