        '3-5', $q$Field Day$q$, $q$(1) Field Day is my favorite day of the school year. (2) In the morning, every class meets on the big field behind the school. (3) The first event is the sack race, where we hop to the finish line in cloth bags. (4) After that, we play tug of war against the other fourth-grade class. (5) Then we cool off with the water balloon toss. (6) ____, everyone sits in the shade and eats frozen fruit bars.

(7) Field Day is not only about winning. (8) Our teachers give out ribbons for teamwork and good sportsmanship. (9) Last year, Ana won a ribbon for cheering for every single runner. (10) My older brother's favorite subject is science. (11) At the end of the day, we are tired, but we are all smiling.$q$, 'draft')
