   $q$Which word best fills the blank at the beginning of sentence 6?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Finally,","is_correct":true},{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-sequence"},{"text":"First,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-time-order"},{"text":"But,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-sequence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Finally,$q$, $q$Sentence 6 tells the last thing that happens after the events in sentences 3 to 5, so "Finally" fits. "First" is wrong because other events already came before it.$q$, 'draft', '10ef2820-524b-557c-8b68-b7dde53976fd')
