   $q$What idea does the quotation in sentence 11 help the writer show?$q$, $q$[{"text":"how to cut scraps into triangles","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"that a quilt can hold a family's memories","is_correct":true},{"text":"that cloth cost a lot of money long ago","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-paragraph-idea"},{"text":"why some patterns have special names","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$that a quilt can hold a family's memories$q$, $q$Mrs. Nwosu says every square holds a memory, which supports the idea in sentence 8 that quilts tell stories. The cost of cloth is from paragraph 2 and is not mentioned in the quotation.$q$, 'draft', '26e5d508-9652-5d00-ba54-e21a6c7ad793')
