-- Passage wg5-narrative-writing-p06
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('7daaee56-74b9-5cdd-af42-a6b11d4ff7d9', 'wg5-narrative-writing-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g5-narrative-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Letters Under the Flagpole$q$, $q$(1) Our school turned fifty years old this year, and Principal Nakamura announced a surprise. (2) A time capsule had been buried under the flagpole when the school first opened. (3) On a sunny Friday, every class gathered on the field to watch the custodian, Mr. Bello, dig it up. (4) The metal box was old, and it opened. (5) Inside, we found a class photo, a stack of letters, and a cassette tape. (6) My favorite lunch is tomato soup. (7) Principal Nakamura read one letter out loud.

(8) It was written by a fifth grader named Ruthie in the year the school opened. (9) She wrote that she hoped future students would still play kickball at recess. (10) Everyone laughed, because we had played kickball that very morning. (11) Later, our class wrote our own letters for a new time capsule. (12) I wrote about our tablets, our class turtle, and our favorite games.

(13) The time capsule was buried again.$q$, 'draft')
