-- Passage wg5-narrative-writing-p07
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('1586bfd3-b2c2-5c92-85b3-56005c13621c', 'wg5-narrative-writing-p07', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g5-narrative-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Frog That Jumped Too Far$q$, $q$(1) For our school's game design night, my sister Marisol and I decided to code a simple game on the family laptop. (2) In our game, a little frog had to hop across lily pads to reach a fly. (3) We worked on it every evening for a week. (4) On the first night, we drew the frog and the lily pads. (5) On the second night, we wrote the code to make the frog hop.

(6) But when I pressed the arrow key, the frog hopped straight off the screen! (7) Marisol laughed so hard she snorted. (8) We looked through our code line by line. (9) Finally, Marisol pointed at one number. (10) "We told it to jump five hundred steps instead of fifty," she said. (11) I fixed the number, and the frog landed neatly on the next lily pad.

(12) On game night, a lot of kids were there. (13) A first grader named Bao played our game four times in a row. (14) It was a fun week.$q$, 'draft')
